{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/972103-blood-gods-and-void-creatures","id":972103,"title":"Blood Gods and Void Creatures","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-09-18T13:47:40-07:00","id":972103,"title":"Blood Gods and Void Creatures","content":"I reread the Cruac Style peview from Secrets of the Crone and it occurs to me that I have some questions about the care and feed of Void Creatures and Blood Gods.<br /> <br /> First off do they drink blood like a vampire from humans or must they feed from a Vampire like a Ghoul?<br /> <br /> Do they need to feed or is it optional, for when they need more vitae for disciplines?<br /> <br /> Second of all do they share the strengths and vulneribles of a vampire?<br /> <br /> Can a Blood God walk in daylight, can a Void Creature heal its wounds with vitae like Vampire, do they take extra damage from fire? Does a Blood God only take bashing damage from fire arms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-18T17:49:56-07:00","id":972237,"title":"","content":"I just reread the comments section of the preview. I didn't realize more vitae then one per particapant could be spent in the God ritual.<br /> <br /> I also realized that if one granted a Blood God 5 Cruac and the ritual that made them, they could use it to create more, potientially more powerful verisons of their kind. It could get crazy.<br /> <br /> I also noticed it doesn't say all the body parts have to be human, you could give the body of human, but the head of a bull or a lioness.<br /> <br /> Lastly I could see a particularly powerful one becoming Prince of a City, backed by the Circle of the Crone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-19T02:24:03-07:00","id":972415,"title":"","content":"Until Secrets comes out the only people who know are Onyx Path staff, I too really want that book but for all we know at present they may have dropped them from the book entirely (not very likely but it could happen).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T08:53:24-07:00","id":973158,"title":"","content":"True, you have a good point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-20T14:52:56-07:00","id":973403,"title":"","content":"I just want to know what the third dot of \u017diva is going to be, they must have worked it out by now but they haven't updated the doc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4714-live-bait","name":"Live Bait","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"703"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T07:20:01-07:00","id":986745,"title":"","content":"Until I know better I'm going to assume blood Gods and Void Creatures are a form of Vampire that aren't Kindred, as far as feeding and gaining vitae goes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T08:59:47-07:00","id":986790,"title":"","content":"Do these things replace the gargoyles (from danse macabre, was it ?) ? Cause I sort of liked them, even though they could have been more fun. That stitching body parts, human and animal, sounds potentially cool, though (although potentially very close to prometheans or pandorans) and having one of those be a prince sounds like such a terrible idea, it's great. I wouldn't be against a good consistent gargoyle (or whatever they'll be called) making system.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7104-s-brechen","name":"S. Brechen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"171"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-13T13:37:18-07:00","id":986924,"title":"","content":"Well I have some postulation regarding the origin of Void Creatures, but as to the rest all I can do is think back to the description of Blood Sorcery from Sacraments &amp; Blasphemies stating that Blood Sorcery cannot create or manipulate fire or sunlight, and that most things created by Blood Sorcery are destroyed when they come into contact with daylight or fire.<br /> <br /> I believe Void Creatures are another tie to the strange abyssal realm that the Strix originally hailed from before settling in the delicious life filled world of Chronicles of Darkness, and that Void Familiars are just other strange and life hungry creatures from that otherworldly realm. That said I believe the description was vague enough that STs should have the final say in where they originate from, if they want to delve into that at all, but that it stands to reason that they have some sort of connection to the Strix in both appearance and otherworldly mentality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3436-dusksage","name":"Dusksage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3436_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"869"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-15T11:48:23-07:00","id":987865,"title":"","content":"Okay that makes sense then, so vulnerible to sun light and fire. And I guess feeding like Kindred.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}